%SIXMD 1
# @?DATE - PRINT SYSTEM DATE AND TIME

## DESCRIPTION

DATE READS THE CURRENT DAIMOS WALL CLOCK AND PRINTS THE CALENDAR DATE AND
TIME.  IT DOES NOT SET THE CLOCK.
USAGE IS 'DATE'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
